\uddfa\ufe0f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ enemies\u00a0\ud83d\udc79</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least one boss fight\u00a0\ud83d\udc40</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ quests\u00a0\u2757\ufe0f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ challenge runs\u00a0\ud83c\udfaf</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 upgradeable items\u00a0\ud83c\udf81</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 stat buffing mutations\u00a0\ud83e\uddec</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique music for every level\u00a0\ud83c\udfb5</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ wearable items you can unlock \ud83c\udfa9</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timed live events with even more wearables to win\u00a0\u23f1\ufe0f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards to compete with other players\u00a0\ud83d\udcc8</p></li></ul>","developers":["Giant Fox Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173780/82808af85b51bf5d82bc39d8e25600a48d46b236/header.jpg?t=1759496841","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Mac<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal capable Intel and AMD GPUs</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3173780/1939129233/d4ffce774f16d1b91acccd09d01ef26500f7e5d4/1758540690/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759135916","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3173780/1939129233/d4ffce774f16d1b91acccd09d01ef26500f7e5d4/1758540690/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759135916","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3173780/1939129233/d4ffce774f16d1b91acccd09d01ef26500f7e5d4/1758540690/hls_264_ma