't really care. If it's alive it's going in my mouth.\u201d<br>DangerouslyFunny<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173780/a5d61376803235be87203b4a832477799204dfc3/ss_a5d61376803235be87203b4a832477799204dfc3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759496841","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173780/a5d61376803235be87203b4a832477799204dfc3/ss_a5d61376803235be87203b4a832477799204dfc3.600x338.jpg?t=1759496841"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173780/d0603ccd5f113ff7f144ae54a6e6f2864707c222/ss_d0603ccd5f113ff7f144ae54a6e6f2864707c222.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759496841","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173780/d0603ccd5f113ff7f144ae54a6e6f2864707c222/ss_d0603ccd5f113ff7f144ae54a6e6f2864707c222.600x338.jpg?t=1759496841"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173780/1a9f852e49e99757cd65fee900164198705cfff6/ss_1a9f852e49e99757cd65fee900164198705cfff6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759496841","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173780/1a9f852e49e99757cd65fee900164198705cfff6/ss_1a9f852e49e99757cd65fee900164198705cfff6.600x338.jpg?t=1759496841"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173780/bc47c7c35eed233d53bc492fe1d8b42fc314df05/ss_bc47c7c35eed233d53bc492fe1d8b42fc314df05.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759496841","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173780/bc47c7c35eed233d53bc492fe1d8b42fc314df05/ss_bc47c7c35eed233d53bc492fe1d8b42fc314df05.600x338.jpg?t=1759496841"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173780/df7160c88f2d70044cf8dbdb503201e25186e7f2/ss_df7160c88f2d70044cf8dbdb503201e25186e7f2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759496841","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.ak