sting forms. Consuming human flesh? Fair game. Police cars, tanks, missiles? Mild indigestion. Try out hundreds of appetizing build combinations!","steam_appid":3173780,"support_info":{"email":"support@giantfoxstudios.com","url":"http://www.giantfoxstudios.com"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://giantfoxstudios.com"}